{{Bug|If used against {{e|Mom}}'s foot, both will count as their own instance, and the second foot will only be able to be killed once the first one is dead.
If the first foot is killed instantly, the second foot may never drop, requiring a reset.}}
{{Bug|If used during {{e|Min-Min}}'s phase change, both bosses will be unable to be damaged.}}
